# Reference benchmark run outputs (jit:a03b2556)
# host.txt is regenerated by run.sh; results/ is per-run CSV output;
# compiled reference binaries are produced inside the container and
# bind-mounted out into reference/.
benchmarks/host.txt
# Per-run CSV output; ad-hoc bench runs stay local. Specific evidence
# CSVs that are linked to JIT issues are unignored below.
benchmarks/results/*
benchmarks/results/.*
# Exception (jit:b13799ac R2): the canonical b13799ac evidence CSV
# carries the protocol § 5 `(matmul, GF(2^32))` row and must be
# tracked per protocol contract.
!benchmarks/results/20260505T091600Z.csv
