# Sparse-smoke ground-truth artefact (jit:96fde7c7). Regenerated on
# every `benchmarks/smoke.sh` invocation by the
# `sparse_smoke_emit_expected` Cargo example. .gitignored so a stale
# committed copy cannot mask gf2-core regressions.
benchmarks/expected/sparse_smoke_n16.bin

# GF(2^32) smoke ground-truth artefact (jit:b13799ac R2). Regenerated on
# every `benchmarks/smoke.sh` / `run.sh --smoke-equality` invocation by
# the `gf2pow32_smoke_emit_expected` Cargo example. .gitignored so a
# stale committed copy cannot mask gf2-core regressions in the
# GF(2^32) matmul path.
benchmarks/expected/gf2pow32_smoke_n16.bin
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# GPU hard-fail diagnostic dumps (gf2-sim `42eac5cc`; runtime-generated per fatal GPU event)
dev/benchmarks/gf2-sim/diagnostic-dumps/
